1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,050
Listen to a short talk on biology.

2
00:00:02,050 --> 00:00:03,740
Now the Australia jumping spider

3
00:00:04,060 --> 00:00:06,210
as you can image got its name for its ability to leap.

4
00:00:06,210 --> 00:00:07,771
But it can swim too.

5
00:00:07,771 --> 00:00:10,900
What's most interesting though is its ability to use try

6
00:00:10,900 --> 00:00:13,080
and error tactics when solving problems.

7
00:00:13,080 --> 00:00:16,017
Now the jumping spider attacks and eats other spiders.

8
00:00:16,017 --> 00:00:19,280
It'll sit at the edge of another spider's web

9
00:00:19,280 --> 00:00:24,828
and attract the spider by tapping out different signals to mimic the struggles of a trapped insect

10
00:00:24,828 --> 00:00:29,070
and it'll keep changing the signals till successfully lured its prey out.

11
00:00:29,070 --> 00:00:34,367
Well, to see if the jumping spider could apply the same problem solving technique,

12
00:00:34,367 --> 00:00:38,150
try and error to unfamiliar situations, scientists conducted an experiment.

13
00:00:38,150 --> 00:00:40,480
They field a trap full of water and

14
00:00:40,480 --> 00:00:42,300
then put some sand in the middle, like an island.

15
00:00:42,300 --> 00:00:46,220
In between the island and the edge of the trap, they put a rock.

16
00:00:46,220 --> 00:00:47,980
When they put the spider on the island

17
00:00:48,260 --> 00:00:51,260
some tried jumping to the rock, and some tried swimming.

18
00:00:51,260 --> 00:01:00,060
All the spiders that successfully reached the rock either by jumping or by swimming use the same method to make it from the rock to the edge of the tree.

19
00:01:00,060 --> 00:01:04,050
If the spider failed to reach the rock, it was placed back on the island,

20
00:01:04,050 --> 00:01:05,240
but the next time they try to leave

21
00:01:05,540 --> 00:01:09,104
spiders did opposite of whatever didn't work the first time,

22
00:01:09,104 --> 00:01:12,030
leaping if it had swum, or swimming if it had leaped.

23
00:01:12,030 --> 00:01:14,140
So we see the spiders using the same try

24
00:01:14,140 --> 00:01:17,120
and error in crossing the water as they used in hunting.
